id: pm-tknnzp
title: Expose safe reviewed migration for historical merge receipts
description: GitHub 1446 reports that unchanged pm-beads receipts reviewed by older merge_reconcile events are gated again after upgrading from 2026.10.8 to 2026.10.9. The advertised dry-run cannot prove snapshots and omits the documented force-review recovery. Reproduce on immutable downstream data and determine the compatible settled-receipt and recovery contract without destructive receipt cleanup.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-12T13:31:52.812Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-12T20:08:20.520Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-12T19:53:16.197Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-12T19:53:16.197Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce 2026.10.8, 2026.10.9 and current SDK against isolated exact downstream data; distinguish historical reviewed receipt proof from unreviewed decisions; preserve immutable evidence and unchanged bytes on refusals; any force review guidance names its audit requirements; independent regressions and all-source coverage pass."
parent: pm-atfm
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: Dry-run and health recovery name the explicitly reviewed force/message migration and its limitations. Unsealed historical audit context remains unauthenticated and pending; explicit fixture review appends modern sealed settlement evidence while preserving the old event context and timestamp.
expected_result: Receipt inspection never trusts item-state-only hashes as audit authentication or rewrites evidence; historical or compacted receipt proof gets an actionable reviewed migration path.
actual_result: "Both published2026.10.8 and2026.10.9 gate all eight exact downstream receipts, so the reported version contrast is unconfirmed. The unsafe source8eb1e56 negative control fails both captured cases; final39-case regressions, linked tests, four typechecks and packed Node24/26/Bun consumers pass. Matching and forged unsealed contexts remain pending on unchanged reads; isolated explicit migration seals and clears captured lossy/lossless receipts. No real downstream data was force-reconciled."
